' UC-FMG-03 — Configure Facility Module Availability

@startuml
skinparam conditionStyle inside
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFEAA7
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #DFE6E9

|WAH Central Administrator|
start
:1.0 Access facility module administration;

|WAHrden System|
:1.1 Verify administrator authority;
if (Authorized?) then (No [EF-01])
  :Present access-denied result;
  kill
else (Yes)
  :1.2 Present facility search/selection tool;
endif

|WAH Central Administrator|
:2.0 Select healthcare facility;

|WAHrden System|
if (Facility found?) then (No [EF-02])
  :Present facility-not-found result;
  kill
else (Yes [2.1])
  :Present current facility-specific module availability;
endif

|WAH Central Administrator|
:3.0 Select module & configuration action\n(Add, Remove, Enable, or Disable);

|WAHrden System|
:3.1 Present proposed resulting module setup;
:3.2 Validate against module & governance constraints;
if (Module unavailable for context?) then (Yes [EF-03])
  :Present configuration-availability error;
  kill
elseif (Violates governance constraint?) then (Yes [EF-04])
  :Present configuration-conflict result;
  kill
else (Valid)
  :Present validated configuration for review;
endif

|WAH Central Administrator|
if (Confirm configuration?) then (No / Cancel [EF-05])
  :Cancel module configuration;
  kill
else (Yes [3.3])
  :Confirm module configuration changes;
endif

|WAHrden System|
:4.0 Apply facility module configuration;
if (Application succeeded?) then (No [EF-06])
  :Present configuration failure result;
  kill
else (Yes)
  |Database / Audit|
  :4.1 Record configuration change & audit trail;
  
  |WAHrden System|
  :4.2 Present resulting module availability;
endif

|WAH Central Administrator|
:Review updated module configuration;
stop
@enduml
